OL,3,GNEWSAThousands turn out in Edinburgh to
OL,4,Aprotest against AI data centres
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Scottish government will soon
OL,7,Fpublish new planning guidance on data
OL,8,Fcentres and said it was developing a
OL,9,Fstrategy to maximise the "public
OL,10,Fbenefit".
